# Imagine Your Rail Line uses no secrets by default.
#
# The map renders with OpenStreetMap tiles, which require no API key, so the
# tool runs fully static on GitHub Pages with nothing to configure.
#
# If a contributor later swaps in a premium basemap (e.g. Mapbox) for higher-
# fidelity renderings, add the token here and document it. Copy this file to
# .env.local (gitignored) before adding real values.

# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=   # Optional. Get from #dev-resources on Slack.
